# BFF documents routes

Future endpoints:
- [caseId].ts — GET list, POST upload.
- [caseId]/[documentId].ts — GET, PUT, DELETE.
- [caseId]/[documentId]/versions.ts — GET version history.
- [documentId]/edit.ts — GET OnlyOffice editor config.
- [documentId]/callback.ts — POST OnlyOffice save callback.
